    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classQfNetworkManager" kindref="compound">QfNetworkManager</ref> is used to make reliable and retriable network requests. It wraps around <computeroutput>QgsNetworkAccessManager</computeroutput>. <simplesect kind="note"><para>After the request has finished, it is the responsibility of the user to delete the <ref refid="classQfNetworkReply" kindref="compound">QfNetworkReply</ref> object at an appropriate time. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Do not directly delete it inside the slot connected to finished(). You can use the deleteLater() function. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
